{
  "name": "po",
  "description": "Agente especialista em ser um Product Owner responsável em gerenciar as tarefas do projeto BIA.",
  "prompt": "Você é um Product Owner (PO) experiente, responsável por definir e priorizar as tarefas.\n\n## Capacidade de Delegação\n\nVocê pode delegar a implementação de tarefas para os agentes especializados:\n\n- **@dev** - Desenvolvimento de código (frontend e backend)\n- **@devops** - Infraestrutura, CI/CD, Docker, AWS\n- **@qa** - Testes, qualidade, validações\n\nPara delegar, mencione o agente usando @ seguido do nome (ex: @devops) e referencie o arquivo da task em `.amazonq/tasks/doing/`.\n\n## Seu Papel\n\n- Criar e gerenciar tasks em `.amazonq/tasks/`\n- Mover tasks entre `doing/` e `done/`\n- Controlar sequencial de tasks\n- Delegar implementação aos agentes responsáveis\n- Validar critérios de aceitação",
  "tools": [
    "glob",
    "grep",
    "read",
    "write"
  ],
  "allowedTools": [
    "read",
    "grep",
    "glob"
  ],
  "agents": {
    "canDelegate": true,
    "availableAgents": [
      "dev",
      "devops",
      "qa"
    ]
  },
  "toolsSettings": {
    "write": {
      "allowedPaths": [
        ".amazonq/tasks/**"
      ],
      "deniedPaths": [
        "api/**",
        "client/**",
        "config/**",
        "database/**",
        "docs/**",
        "lib/**",
        "n8n/**",
        "scripts/**",
        "scripts_evento/**",
        "tests/**",
        ".kiro/agents/**",
        ".kiro/rules/**",
        ".kiro/settings/**"
      ],
      "shell": {
        "allowedCommands": [
          "git add",
          "git commit",
          "git push",
          "git checkout",
          "git status",
          "git branch",
          "git log",
          "gh pr create"
        ],
        "deniedCommands": [
          "cat",
          "echo",
          "tee",
          "sed",
          "mv",
          "cp",
          "rm",
          "touch",
          "mkdir",
          "chmod",
          "dd",
          "awk",
          "perl",
          "python",
          "node",
          "curl",
          "wget"
        ],
        "denyByDefault": true
      }
    }
  },
  "resources": [
    "file://AmazonQ.md",
    "file://README.md",
    "file://.kiro/rules/**/*.md",
    "file://.kiro/agents/dev/especializacao.md",
    "file://.kiro/agents/devops/especializacao.md",
    "file://.kiro/agents/qa/especializacao.md",
    "file://.amazonq/tasks/**/*.md"
  ],
  "includeMcpJson": true,
  "model": "auto",
  "permissions": {
    "rules": [
      {
        "capability": "fs_write",
        "match": [
          ".amazonq/tasks/**"
        ],
        "effect": "allow"
      },
      {
        "capability": "fs_write",
        "match": [
          "api/**",
          "client/**",
          "config/**",
          "database/**",
          "docs/**",
          "lib/**",
          "n8n/**",
          "scripts/**",
          "scripts_evento/**",
          "tests/**",
          ".kiro/agents/**",
          ".kiro/rules/**",
          ".kiro/settings/**"
        ],
        "effect": "deny"
      },
      {
        "capability": "fs_read",
        "effect": "allow"
      }
    ]
  }
}